    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Large numbers of bedbugs ("
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bedbugs",
            "zh": "臭虫"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ") have hit Paris. In videos on social media, these pests are seen in the city’s trains, subways, cinemas, and even hospitals."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These bugs are no bigger than "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "apple pips",
            "zh": "苹果籽"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They feed on human blood, but the health risk from them is, in fact, not very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They only cause "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "itchy bites",
            "zh": "发痒的咬痕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and a small risk of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "allergies",
            "zh": "过敏反应"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "secondary infections",
            "zh": "继发感染"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the tiny bugs can cause a big "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "psychological impact",
            "zh": "心理影响"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when they appear in large numbers. If a person brings bedbugs back home, it can be very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "get rid of",
            "zh": "摆脱"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You shouldn’t take pleasure in Parisians’ "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "misfortune",
            "ref": "v-misfortune"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", though. Bedbugs are not just in the French capital. They’re making a comeback everywhere. In "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Zurich",
            "zh": "苏黎世"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", bedbug complaints "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about 20 a year between 1995 and 2005. Around 2015, however, there were six times more complaints. And New York City went through a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "panic",
            "ref": "v-panic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to Paris’s today about a decade ago. “There won’t be a city without bedbugs,” says Clive Boase, a pest-control expert."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It is another tale of globalisation and climate change. Warm cities provide perfect "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for bedbugs. Cheap travel helps them spread. And worse still, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "insecticides",
            "zh": "杀虫剂"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " used to kill them are losing their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "During the day, the bugs hide in dark places. At night, they come out to eat. Warm, centrally heated homes make their life cycles even "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". A warming climate works in the same way."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After World War II, the introduction and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "widespread",
            "ref": "v-widespread"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " use of insecticides almost "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wiped out",
            "zh": "消灭"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the bugs in most rich-world houses. However, over time, the insects developed resistance—the poisons "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " work on them anymore. Modern bedbugs don’t seem to be affected by some insecticides."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "New insecticides could probably be invented in the future. But for now, at least, we cannot get rid of the bugs. There is much you can do to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bringing them home with you, but we have no choice but to live—"
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "occasionally",
            "ref": "v-occasionally"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—alongside them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
